[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐……！<br>也许其中还有<br>我们不知道的情报……|#0103Trial09_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL3,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Angry_Open2
