; MARK: 3-9-3: ❌ 疑問・魔法の実験って？

# Judge3-9-3

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:你说的魔法实验……到底做了些什么？|#0103Trial09_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:其实没什么特别的，<br>只是按照书上的内容实践了一下而已。|#0103Trial09_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:一种促进魔法成长的术式……<br>通过杀死少女，让她成长为魔女。|#0103Trial09_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_Common_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
